@startuml dfd-2-auth
!include _skin.puml
title DFD mức 2 — 1.0 Xác thực người dùng
caption JWT tự phát hành (PyJWT) + bcrypt; không dùng Supabase

actor "Giao diện\n(LoginScreen / api.js)" as UI

rectangle "1.1\nĐăng ký\nRegisterUser" as Reg
rectangle "1.2\nĐăng nhập\nLoginUser" as Login
rectangle "1.3\nGác cổng JWT\nResolveUserId /\nget_current_user_id" as Gate
rectangle "1.4\nBăm mật khẩu\nBcryptPasswordHasher" as Hash
rectangle "1.5\nPhát hành / đọc JWT\nJwtTokenService" as Jwt

database "D1.1 users\n(id, email, password_hash)" as Users

UI --> Reg : POST /api/v1/auth/register\n{email, password ≥ 6}
Reg --> Hash : password thuần
Hash --> Reg : password_hash
Reg --> Users : INSERT email + hash
Users --> Reg : User / ConflictError (409)
Reg --> Jwt : user_id, email
Jwt --> Reg : access_token
Reg --> UI : {access_token, token_type, user_id, email}

UI --> Login : POST /api/v1/auth/login\n{email, password}
Login --> Users : SELECT theo email
Users --> Login : User / không có
Login --> Hash : verify(password, hash)
Hash --> Login : đúng / sai
Login --> Jwt : user_id, email
Jwt --> Login : access_token
Login --> UI : token JSON / 401

UI --> Gate : Authorization: Bearer <JWT>\n(mọi API trừ /models, /health, auth)
Gate --> Jwt : parse_access_token
Jwt --> Gate : payload.sub = user_id / AuthError
Gate --> UI : UUID user_id cho use case\nhoặc HTTP 401

note right of UI
  Frontend lưu JSON vào
  **localStorage** khóa ``contractlens_auth``.
  Đăng xuất chỉ xóa localStorage,
  không gọi API.
end note

note bottom of Gate
  Gác cổng trước: upload, analyze,
  analyze/resume, contracts, chat,
  chat/stream, history, states, rewind.
  Nguồn: ``app/api/deps.py``, ``auth.py``.
end note

@enduml
